73dbf3c97a152dab01cda66b \n2. Generating a HalBufferView manually with similar attributes using above script still passes, as for memory_type `HOST_VISIBLE` value is added by default. Unable to create one with only `memory_type=DEVICE_LOCAL`, which errors out. \n3. Full repro involves sharktank kernel. Steps are [here](https://gist.github.com/archana-ramalingam/d3cd9111fc7517b9c01e4391731cb832?permalink_comment_id=5471329#gistcomment-5471329)\n\n### What component(s) does this issue relate to?\n\nRuntime\n\n### Version information\n\niree-base-compiler==3.3.0rc20250303\niree-base-runtime==3.3.0rc20250303\niree-turbine==3.3.0rc20250303\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","closed_at":"2025-03-07T20:12:25Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98564406?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/archana-ramalingam","id":98564406,"login":"archana-ramalingam","node_id":"U_kgDOBd_5Ng","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/archana-ramalingam","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20170/comments","created_at":"2025-03-06T05:12:43Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/20170/events","html_url":